{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Reinforcements are not coming. Resupply is impossible. Your ascent begins.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Tower of Kalemonvo</strong> is a challenging dark fantasy Action RPG - following the slower pace and high tension seen in genre-defining classics like <i>Diablo 1</i> and <i>Throne of Darkness</i>. Defeat wicked foes, grow stronger, gather whatever loot you can find, and tread lightly - as every encounter could be your last!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2351860/extras/classicarpg2.png?t=1743636392\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2351860/extras/launchgif1.gif?t=1743636392\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Randomly Generated Dungeon</strong><br>Rooms, rewards and foes are never the same across two playthroughs. Your path to the top will be yours alone.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Deep Itemization and Mystical Rare Items</strong>  <br>Kalemonvo's loot system is about quality over quantity, carrying risks and rewards to continually reshape your build. Find unique pieces that allow for strange new playstyles: like a powerful but ravenous mask that consumes your potions, a pair of versatile shields made for dual-wielding, or a ghostly cape that makes you incorporeal.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2351860/extras/deepcustom2.png?t=1743636392\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2351860/extras/gif5.gif?t=1743636392\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Classless Character Progression</strong> <br>If you have the stats, you can equip any item, cast any spell or perform any combat feat. Play as a max-strength brawler, nimble summoner archer, or fireball throwing hammer-wizard. Adapt and experiment with your build to fit any playstyle you prefer. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Combat Arts and Item Skills</strong><br>Combat is about more than just hacking and slashing. Each weapon type comes with their own arsenal of distinct skills: from throwing two-handed scythes, launching ricochet arrows, or reflecting projectiles with a shield. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2351860/extras/brutaldiff2.png?t=1743636392\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2351860/extras/gif6.gif?t=1743636392\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Limited Resources</strong><br>The <i>Tower</i> is not for the faint of heart. Potions are scarce, vendors are limited, and there is no town to Portal back to.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A Deadly Climb...</strong><br>Hellish demons, undead warriors, mysterious cultists and many other malevolent beings will do whatever it takes to halt your advance. Only the most dedicated players will be able to succeed. <br><br><strong><i>Do you have what it takes?</i></strong></p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Saw that coming","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2351860/37bb125f042abee50f3ff2a0de6251c6b94307a7.jpg"},{"name":"Master Wizard","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2351860/4a128b463b1de43d8f84457fa7f9b477518d461b.jpg"},{"name":"Victory","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2351860/5d578cd28a9b5e2bdf4a6b57288d5d1e98722e91.jpg"},{"name":"Things will never be the same","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2351860/55fb9ccd4522659513da8ca295bcc645f301ed97.jpg"},{"name":"You did it, but at what cost?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2351860/bcbb0fa222e61603a40d3a7f30401a0b58bf4533.jpg"},{"name":"Permanently Hasted","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2351860/8dc71238e49bd75bb8b132b9ea259d2d58808ad6.jpg"},{"name":"None will survive","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2351860/ff086d538c19933b2d4077a2b5ccda40412724cf.jpg"},{"name":"What's down there?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2351860/763c3c088e589cf0fb3d85128d4af874e2d61906.jpg"},{"name":"I don't feel so good","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2351860/e551a59bd572f913c2932cd3214724dcd52d8c9d.jpg"},{"name":"Reinforcements have arrived","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2351860/f7f508e7d135c1f42608f401ac6c59fb3d487e9a.jpg"}],"total":25},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2351860?t=1743636392","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2351860/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743636392","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2351860/7b19e566ea6e78d6ae68cab4371f58498efebc2c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743636392","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2351860/7b19e566ea6e78d6ae68cab4371f58498efebc2c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743636392","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Tower of Kalemonvo may contain content not appropriate for all ages, or may not be appropriate for viewing at work. It contains: Frequent Violence or Gore, General Mature Content an